FRAME ORDER (FR5, NFR1)
- advance() is the whole game frame: wanderers, motor, actor, feedback stack, fleet clock, HUD ability-busy edge, then the vehicle frame (camera target, shadow focus, engine note, bonks, the town, the pond splash) and the mission frame (registry, pacers, helper hand).
- The camera port declares only { facing, setTarget, followSun }. It has no update/snapTo/resize: the rig's own easing stays at the edge and runs after the game frame, so the camera never lags. The suite's strict proxy would throw if the controller reached for it.
- The DOM chrome (hold gate, parent panel, install hint) runs between the game frame and rig.update. It is DOM-only and shares no state with the world or the fleet.

